1
00:00:46,480 --> 00:00:47,200
Chu Nanfeng,

2
00:00:47,840 --> 00:00:49,820
if you dare to step into this place today,

3
00:00:50,680 --> 00:00:51,360
just try it!

4
00:00:51,740 --> 00:00:53,000
Don't use Wan as an excuse.

5
00:00:55,160 --> 00:00:56,740
Do you think I'm afraid of you?

6
00:01:00,020 --> 00:01:01,100
Put your guns down!

7
00:01:03,900 --> 00:01:04,540
Young Master,

8
00:01:04,940 --> 00:01:06,620
you don't need to worry about me.

9
00:01:08,780 --> 00:01:09,740
Let's go back first.

10
00:01:29,380 --> 00:01:30,800
No matter what happened,

11
00:01:31,240 --> 00:01:32,280
let's have a good meal first.

12
00:01:33,400 --> 00:01:34,300
I'm here for you.

13
00:01:37,260 --> 00:01:38,180
Ling Shenxing,

14
00:01:38,720 --> 00:01:40,120
if I remember correctly,

15
00:01:40,240 --> 00:01:42,140
this is our first time eating out alone.

16
00:01:42,760 --> 00:01:43,640
Is this a date?

17
00:01:49,580 --> 00:01:51,020
If you like,

18
00:01:51,620 --> 00:01:53,040
I can take you out every day.

19
00:01:57,620 --> 00:02:00,240
[I never thought I'd meet someone]

20
00:02:00,580 --> 00:02:02,460
[who could make my heart flutter in this novel world.]

21
00:02:04,460 --> 00:02:06,920
[But I don't know if I'll leave here one day.]

22
00:02:07,280 --> 00:02:09,200
[I don't know if this is a blessing]

23
00:02:09,620 --> 00:02:11,020
[or a misfortune.]

24
00:02:15,700 --> 00:02:18,840
[Perhaps all I can do is cherish the moment.]

25
00:02:50,860 --> 00:02:51,620
Take this for self-defense.

26
00:03:15,740 --> 00:03:16,180
Damn it.

27
00:03:16,180 --> 00:03:17,040
The brakes have failed.

28
00:03:17,040 --> 00:03:18,340
Someone must have tampered with the car.

29
00:03:21,500 --> 00:03:22,400
Wan, wake up.

30
00:03:22,600 --> 00:03:23,920
Wan, wake up.

31
00:03:38,920 --> 00:03:40,060
Are you okay?

32
00:03:44,500 --> 00:03:45,460
Are you okay?

33
00:03:46,160 --> 00:03:47,440
I'm fine.

34
00:03:47,440 --> 00:03:48,280
Be careful.

35
00:03:56,020 --> 00:03:56,800
What happened?

36
00:03:57,900 --> 00:03:59,120
I can't move my foot.

37
00:04:01,640 --> 00:04:02,640
I'll help you over there.

38
00:04:02,640 --> 00:04:03,000
Okay.

39
00:04:21,220 --> 00:04:22,780
You must have sprained your ankle

40
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:23,940
when jumping off the car.

41
00:04:27,640 --> 00:04:28,400
Wait a minute.

42
00:04:46,260 --> 00:04:46,900
Unfasten the belt.

43
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:47,600
Ah.

44
00:04:51,500 --> 00:04:52,360
What are you thinking?

45
00:04:57,040 --> 00:04:58,400
I don't want a disabled husband.

46
00:05:08,340 --> 00:05:09,800
When I was studying medicine,

47
00:05:10,220 --> 00:05:11,460
I met a man who was like you.

48
00:05:11,940 --> 00:05:13,300
He was seriously injured,

49
00:05:13,300 --> 00:05:14,280
but he kept delaying treatment,

50
00:05:15,100 --> 00:05:16,440
which led to complications

51
00:05:16,440 --> 00:05:17,360
and he died.

52
00:05:17,700 --> 00:05:18,800
Don't be like him.

53
00:05:19,060 --> 00:05:19,920
That man,

54
00:05:20,580 --> 00:05:21,580
didn't anyone care about him?

55
00:05:22,500 --> 00:05:23,440
Of course,

56
00:05:23,560 --> 00:05:24,460
many people cared about him.

57
00:05:25,060 --> 00:05:25,940
But

58
00:05:26,180 --> 00:05:27,580
he always carried everything on his own.

59
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:34,060
So the Young Marshal

60
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:35,060
is afraid of pain.

61
00:05:45,300 --> 00:05:45,980
Someone is coming.

62
00:05:45,980 --> 00:05:46,560
Go.

63
00:05:48,780 --> 00:05:49,360
Over there.

64
00:05:51,560 --> 00:05:52,200
Search.

65
00:05:55,620 --> 00:05:56,200
That way.

66
00:05:58,520 --> 00:05:59,180
Go.

67
00:06:06,880 --> 00:06:08,380
They're obviously here to find us.

68
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:11,760
They may be in league with the saboteur.

69
00:06:17,320 --> 00:06:19,440
They're obviously trying to kill us.

70
00:06:20,700 --> 00:06:21,800
Ling Shenxing is injured.

71
00:06:22,220 --> 00:06:23,500
I have to lure them away.

72
00:06:38,960 --> 00:06:39,960
Ling Shenxing,

73
00:06:40,980 --> 00:06:42,160
do you trust me?

74
00:06:42,760 --> 00:06:44,280
I do.

75
00:06:57,480 --> 00:06:58,800
What are you doing?

76
00:07:00,700 --> 00:07:01,520
Wan.

77
00:07:14,640 --> 00:07:15,980
Ling Shenxing.

78
00:07:16,320 --> 00:07:17,640
I love you.

79
00:07:18,480 --> 00:07:19,800
No matter what the outcome,

80
00:07:20,840 --> 00:07:23,200
I hope you can live well.

81
00:07:24,160 --> 00:07:26,160
[Ling Shenxing always protects me.]

82
00:07:27,080 --> 00:07:28,260
[Although I was injured,]

83
00:07:28,260 --> 00:07:29,180
[this time,]

84
00:07:30,200 --> 00:07:32,040
[it's my turn to protect him.]

85
00:07:32,380 --> 00:07:33,180
[Ling Shenxing,]

86
00:07:35,020 --> 00:07:36,240
[promise me,]

87
00:07:36,920 --> 00:07:38,400
[if I die,]

88
00:07:38,660 --> 00:07:39,940
[you won't marry anyone else.]

89
00:07:44,880 --> 00:07:45,760
Wan.

90
00:07:47,120 --> 00:07:48,200
Wan.

91
00:07:50,160 --> 00:07:51,240
Come back.

92
00:08:29,100 --> 00:08:29,760
It's me.

93
00:08:30,940 --> 00:08:31,740
Don't be afraid.

94
00:08:33,680 --> 00:08:34,460
It's me.

95
00:08:37,080 --> 00:08:38,580
I'll always be there for you.

96
00:08:42,900 --> 00:08:43,620
Don't be afraid.

97
00:08:45,040 --> 00:08:46,100
As long as you turn around,

98
00:08:46,400 --> 00:08:47,440
I'll always be there.

99
00:08:51,520 --> 00:08:52,740
In this world,

100
00:08:53,340 --> 00:08:54,840
apart from my family,

101
00:08:55,880 --> 00:08:57,940
no one has ever taken care of me.

102
00:09:03,160 --> 00:09:04,940
I'll take care of you from now on.

103
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:14,100
Don't worry.

104
00:09:15,400 --> 00:09:16,680
I'll always be there for you.
